{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001-0","text":"巡狩の運命専用の光円錐、光円錐のスキルはこの運命にのみ有効。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001-1","text":"星海を往来する、\n其の速度は七色の閃光が如く一瞬。\n不死の忌み物を討ち、\n幻の解薬を探し、\n解脱の道を求める。\n其の航海は、破られぬ誓いのように、\n永遠に終わらない。","speaker":""}]}
